        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": ", T D400)",
      "bbox": [
        351.7796936035156,
        244.1781005859375,
        387.65423583984375,
        252.60528564453125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "For this, we would like to minimize the number of times that the particle of the conditioned path is",
      "bbox": [
        57.055999755859375,
        267.37872314453125,
        443.60198974609375,
        275.6905822753906
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "resampled at each iteration. Consider time n, and assume that the conditioned path consists of the ﬁrst",
      "bbox": [
        48.089599609375,
        277.3412780761719,
        443.6073303222656,
        285.65313720703125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "particle at both times n and n+1 (in the notation of the paper Bn =1 and Bn+1 =1). Let On be the number",
      "bbox": [
        48.089599609375,
        286.5506591796875,
        443.6014404296875,
        296.9609069824219
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "of times that the ﬁrst particle at time n is resampled. Then under the conditional SMC algorithm we are",
      "bbox": [
        48.08905029296875,
        297.2666015625,
        443.6014404296875,
        305.5784606933594
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "interested in",
      "bbox": [
        48.08906555175781,
        307.2291564941406,
        94.69641876220703,
        315.541015625
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Pr.On =x|A1",
      "bbox": [
        114.89322662353516,
        327.901123046875,
        164.0738983154297,
        339.0224609375
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "n =1/= Pr.On =x/ Pr.A1",
      "bbox": [
        161.08509826660156,
        322.0641174316406,
        256.97039794921875,
        340.0894470214844
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
